DESCRIPTION:Topic	:	Yoga Stretch at Your Desk	\nSynopsis	:	Stretch out\, re
	lease soreness and refocus your mind at your desk.  Let's take a break and
	 rejuvenate ourselves together!	\nSpeakers	:	Mr Jermey Kok\, Head of Treas
	ury & Markets (HKMC member)	\n	:	Ms Gloria Ngan\, Team Lead\, Strategic Bu
	siness Planning\, T&O (Instructor)	\n\n\n\n_______________________________
	__________________________________________________________________________
	_____\n\nOption 1 – If you are joining via a laptop or mobile device thr
	ough the application:\n1. Click on this hyperlink: Webex Meeting Link  <ht
	tps://dbs.webex.com/dbs/j.php?MTID=m890aa7ec2e27d7c1fd74363673ef86b8> \n2.
	 Use a headset for a better experience\n*Visit here  <https://dbs1bank.sha
	repoint.com/sites/sgFOW/SitePages/fow/digital-tools.aspx?market=Singapore&
	category=Communication> to find out more about Webex \n\nMeeting password:
	 jaKFZCXc484 (only if asked)\n\nOption 2 – If you are joining via Cisco 
	VC Equipment:\nUse the Touch Panel to dial in\n1. Press the "Call" icon\n2
	. Dial 25156956874@dbs.webex.com into the search bar and press "Call" \n3.
	 If you are the host\, enter your 6-digit one-time Host KEY. Click here to
	 see how to retrieve your Host KEY  <https://dbs1bank.sharepoint.com/sites
	/sgFOW/Shared Documents/Forms/AllItems.aspx?viewpath=%2Fsites%2FsgFOW%2FSh
	ared%20Documents&id=%2Fsites%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents%2FGuides%2FWebEx
	%2FUser%20Guide%5FHost%5FPIN%2Epdf&viewid=1b23a731%2D8c47%2D42f0%2Dbd84%2D
	b790e52deffa&parent=%2Fsites%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents%2FGuides%2FWebEx
	> \n\nOption 3 – If you are joining via a laptop through the Web browser
	: \nFor external parties who do not wish to download the application \n1. 
	Click on this hyperlink: Webex Meeting Link  <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/j.
	php?MTID=m890aa7ec2e27d7c1fd74363673ef86b8> \n2. Click on ‘Cancel button
	’ if a popup ‘Open Webex?' appears \n3. Click on ‘Join from your bro
	wser’ \n4. Enter your Name and Email Address and join the meeting \n\nCl
	ick here  <https://help.webex.com/en-us/article/nrbgeodb/Join-a-Webex-Meet
	ing> to find out more\n\nOption 4 – If you are dialling in via phone (au
	dio only):\n*Toll charges / Long distance charges may apply.\nNote if you 
	are the host\, please use either Option 1 or 2 to start the meeting.\nSing
	apore +65-3157-6442 <tel:%2B65-3157-6442\,\,1%23\,%23> \nHong Kong +852-30
	18-6828 <tel:%2B852-3018-6828\,\,1%23\,%23> \nIndia\, Mumbai +91-22-6480-0
	114 <tel:%2B91-22-6480-0114\,\,1%23\,%23> \nIndia\, Hyderabad +91-40-6480-
	0114 <tel:%2B91-40-6480-0114\,\,1%23\,%23> \nTaiwan +886-2-5594-0839 <tel:
	%2B886-2-5594-0839\,\,1%23\,%23> \n\nMeeting Number: 2515 695 6874#\nGloba
	l call-in numbers  <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php> \n\n\nUsef
	ul Links:\nNeed help? Contact Webex Support Team!  <mailto:webexsupport@db
	s.com> \n\n
